OL,3,GNEWSATeacher who struck pupil and swore
OL,4,Aon school trip banned for two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA supply teacher who struck a pupil and
OL,7,Fswore while on a school trip to France
OL,8,Fhas been banned from his profession for
OL,9,Ftwo years.
OL,11,FShon Rowcliffe, 33, had been suspended
OL,12,Ffrom working at Ysgol Bro Preseli while
OL,13,Fan investigation was conducted into the
OL,14,F2024 trip, an Education Workforce
OL,15,FCouncil hearing was told.
OL,17,FA group of Year 7 and 8 football
OL,18,Fstudents - aged 12 and 13 - were part
OL,19,Fof a trip to France to play in a
OL,20,Fcompetition with a school twinned with
OL,21,Fthe school in Crymych, Pembrokeshire.
